# Testing

Vitest is configured (`rtk vitest run`). Prefer RTK for command output.

## When to add or update tests

Add or update tests when the change affects:

- Business logic or calculations
- Persistence or storage adapters
- State transitions
- Bug regressions (repro test when practical)
- Existing tested behavior

Do not add superficial tests solely for coverage. Do not introduce a second test stack.

## Validation

- `rtk vitest run` — targeted tests first; full suite if unsure
- `rtk next build` — only when the change can break production (routing, layout, static export, env, Tauri `out/`)
- Manual when UI or data involved: sidebar, nav, active classroom survives page change

## TDD

Do not require TDD or 80% coverage unless the user explicitly asks.
